{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "爱理", "steam": "愛理"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "愛理"}, "voice": {"chs": "ar2746", "steam": "ar2746", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「唔……唔……好好想想爱理，好好想想，\\n　可不能在这种题上花时间啊，唔唔唔唔……」", "steam": "「唔……唔唔……快想愛理、快想！不能在這種問題花這麼多時間、嗯嗯嗯嗯……」"}, "length": {"chs": 42, "steam": 37}, "similarity": 0.345}
